<title>MALAYSIA: India's STC buys 12,000 tonnes of palm oil-traders.</title>
<headline>India's STC buys 12,000 tonnes of palm oil-traders.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's STC bought 12,000 tonnes of RBD palm olein on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the STC purchased 6,000 tonnes of RBD palm olein at $586 a tonne for first-half October shipment from Malaysia's FELDA.</p>
<p>It also took the other 6,000 tonnes of the same product, paying $581 a tonne for last-half November shipment from Kuok Oils and Grains, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-2308911)</p>
